  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 522.03 Decal Specifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 522.03 Decal Specifications. Each agency authorized under RSA 261-B or RSA 261-C shall produce decals that are:\n\n(a) No more than 3 inches by 3 inches in size;\n\n(b) Made in non-reflectorized material; and\n\n(c) Shall include a unique sequence number.\n\nSource. #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 523.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
